WEBVTT

01:41.000 --> 01:42.720
That scumbag. I'm so mad!

01:43.600 --> 01:45.080
If you didn't stop me,

01:45.160 --> 01:47.240
I would have punched
that darn magistrate's head…

01:50.840 --> 01:51.880
I'm so frustrated.

01:51.960 --> 01:53.240
I'll go for a walk.

02:00.560 --> 02:01.480
Miss.

02:02.800 --> 02:03.720
Tong'er,

02:06.640 --> 02:08.199
I know that magistrate.

02:09.320 --> 02:10.400
A granary

02:10.960 --> 02:13.520
eases people's minds and helps in war.

02:14.800 --> 02:18.560
I entrusted you with the duty
of supervising the granary.

02:19.160 --> 02:21.680
Yet you resorted to fraud

02:21.760 --> 02:22.880
and stole from the nation.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.680
Take off your official uniform.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.640
You don't deserve to be an official.

02:28.520 --> 02:32.080
Feng Yutang was a beggar.

02:33.000 --> 02:34.400
My father took pity on him,

02:35.240 --> 02:37.320
so he gave him a position
in the government office.

02:38.640 --> 02:40.000
He's very smart.

02:41.600 --> 02:43.200
But we didn't expect him

02:43.960 --> 02:46.200
to be a completely rotten person.

02:47.080 --> 02:48.800
A smart magistrate

02:48.880 --> 02:50.360
is not an easy opponent.

02:50.440 --> 02:52.120
Do you have any plans?

02:52.200 --> 02:53.240
Feng Yutang

02:54.520 --> 02:57.160
replaced all my father's subordinates.

03:01.200 --> 03:03.080
HUAIXIANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

03:03.160 --> 03:04.760
Why don't you watch where you're going?

03:04.840 --> 03:06.080
Are you all right, ma'am?

03:14.320 --> 03:16.920
FIFTH HOUSE OF LIHUA ALLEY

03:17.000 --> 03:19.840
She works for Mr. Xue?

03:19.920 --> 03:21.280
We call her Mute Granny.

03:22.360 --> 03:24.080
Perhaps Feng Yutang thought

03:24.160 --> 03:25.400
she's unable to speak,

03:25.480 --> 03:26.680
so he let her stay.

03:27.240 --> 03:29.680
But can she help us?

03:33.600 --> 03:35.400
Since she invited me,

03:37.840 --> 03:39.560
she must have something to tell me.

03:43.120 --> 03:43.960
Uncle Mingyu.

03:44.440 --> 03:45.320
Take Tong'er with you.

03:45.400 --> 03:46.720
I'll see the old lady alone.

03:46.800 --> 03:48.680
No way. Let's go together.

03:50.000 --> 03:50.880
No way.

03:50.960 --> 03:52.840
Feng Yutang is keeping an eye on us.

03:52.920 --> 03:53.960
We must work separately.

03:54.040 --> 03:57.280
- Listen to me. Together, we--
- Listen to me.

03:57.360 --> 03:59.360
Tong'er and I have switched clothes.

03:59.440 --> 04:01.240
They're targeting me.

04:01.320 --> 04:02.720
They won't do anything to Tong'er.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.120
All right then.

04:04.600 --> 04:07.000
Let's meet here in two hours.

04:07.080 --> 04:09.400
If you're not back by then,
I'll look for you with Tong'er.

04:09.480 --> 04:11.000
- All right.
- Let's go.

04:13.200 --> 04:14.040
Ms. Jiang Li.

04:15.720 --> 04:16.560
Go.

04:28.680 --> 04:29.520
Let's go.

04:37.400 --> 04:38.320
We fooled them.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.160
Send one person to follow them.

04:50.240 --> 04:51.360
The rest should wait.

04:51.440 --> 04:52.360
Beware of tricks.

04:53.200 --> 04:54.080
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:07.080 --> 05:08.120
Luckily, I'm smart.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.720
- You two go that way. You come with me.
- Yes.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.880
Come on, let's go that way.

06:17.880 --> 06:20.640
Pretty lady, are you alone?

06:22.680 --> 06:23.800
Pretty lady.

06:23.880 --> 06:25.360
You're so pretty.

06:27.560 --> 06:29.680
- I like her.
- I like her.

06:29.760 --> 06:32.760
She's mine today. Don't take her from me.

06:32.840 --> 06:34.880
I'm coming.

06:37.200 --> 06:39.680
You are quite hot-tempered.

06:39.760 --> 06:40.640
Hit me again.

06:43.280 --> 06:44.160
Go away.

06:44.640 --> 06:46.960
Pretty lady, I like you.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.200
Hit me.

06:53.560 --> 06:55.120
- Pretty lady.
- Pretty lady.

06:55.200 --> 06:58.440
- That hurt so much.
- That was painful.

07:01.960 --> 07:04.680
Let go!

07:05.200 --> 07:06.600
Let me go! Let go!

07:07.440 --> 07:08.320
Let go!

07:13.840 --> 07:15.680
I'm sorry. My fan fell.

07:15.760 --> 07:18.160
Please pick it up for me, pretty lady.

07:22.680 --> 07:24.160
My lord, are you making a move
or should I?

07:24.640 --> 07:26.000
It's a dirty job. You do it.

07:31.040 --> 07:32.880
Ms. Jiang, go to the bridge.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.120
How dare you be so nosy?

08:05.400 --> 08:06.560
Duke Su.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.440
Why did your taste

08:10.040 --> 08:10.960
suddenly change today?

08:12.680 --> 08:13.800
Do you like it,

08:13.880 --> 08:14.840
pretty lady?

08:15.640 --> 08:17.920
Did you follow me to Huaixiang

08:18.000 --> 08:19.640
because you heard that I was coming?

08:22.160 --> 08:25.080
I should be the one asking that question.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.680
I have something important
to do in Huaixiang.

08:31.520 --> 08:33.159
Perhaps the messenger was late.

08:33.720 --> 08:35.400
- What messenger?
- That's not important.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.919
What's the important thing you mentioned?

08:38.480 --> 08:39.840
I'll explain it to you later on.

08:44.400 --> 08:46.640
How can you get things done
when you're being followed?

08:47.760 --> 08:48.800
Search there.

08:54.720 --> 08:55.560
What are you doing?

08:56.440 --> 08:57.560
Thank you so much, Duke Su.

09:01.120 --> 09:01.960
How many are there?

09:02.040 --> 09:03.240
I don't know.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.720
Let them check it out for you then.

09:05.680 --> 09:06.680
Have a cup of tea with me.

09:12.720 --> 09:14.160
Miss, do you want a flower?

09:20.680 --> 09:21.600
Are we not going in?

09:23.720 --> 09:24.960
Have a look here.

09:25.040 --> 09:26.720
Choose a gift for the lady.

09:26.800 --> 09:27.880
I'll give you a discount.

09:40.240 --> 09:41.360
This one suits you.

09:41.960 --> 09:42.840
It's so ugly.

09:48.440 --> 09:49.360
Be convincing.

09:49.840 --> 09:51.960
Let them think
that you're meeting a lover secretly

09:52.040 --> 09:53.800
so they will let down their guard.

09:53.880 --> 09:55.680
Jiang Li, the Chancellor's daughter,

09:56.920 --> 09:58.560
is secretly meeting her lover
in Huaixiang?

09:59.400 --> 10:00.280
Would they believe it?

10:00.840 --> 10:01.680
Why not?

10:03.160 --> 10:04.840
The most popular play since ancient times

10:05.320 --> 10:06.400
has always been this one.

10:07.960 --> 10:09.560
It doesn't matter if it's real or not.

10:10.120 --> 10:11.040
What's important is

10:13.360 --> 10:14.640
to watch someone's reputation

10:15.600 --> 10:18.000
fall into ruins.

10:22.960 --> 10:23.920
Don't move.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.360
Keep calm.

10:26.440 --> 10:29.240
Why do you always
say inappropriate things?

10:31.480 --> 10:33.120
You're thinking too much.

10:37.680 --> 10:40.200
I don't like the word "lover."

10:40.800 --> 10:41.680
What's wrong

10:43.360 --> 10:44.560
with a person with love?

10:49.360 --> 10:50.400
It can't kill you.

10:52.320 --> 10:53.400
But it can kill me.

10:53.960 --> 10:55.080
When you're over it…

10:58.240 --> 10:59.360
it can't kill you.

11:18.160 --> 11:20.360
Have you calmed down, pretty lady?

11:21.400 --> 11:22.400
Yes,

11:22.480 --> 11:23.560
annoying guy.

11:24.520 --> 11:26.680
Miss, this flower looks good as well.

11:38.200 --> 11:40.800
Four in total. We can get them now.

11:43.800 --> 11:46.360
They confessed. Feng Yutang sent them.

11:48.920 --> 11:50.680
Go back and tell your master

11:51.400 --> 11:54.320
that when Duke Su
and Ms. Jiang Li are together,

11:54.400 --> 11:56.120
they don't like being watched.

11:56.200 --> 11:57.760
If we catch you again,

11:57.840 --> 11:59.000
you'll be badly beaten up.

11:59.080 --> 11:59.960
Get lost.

12:00.040 --> 12:01.360
- We'll leave now.
- We'll leave now.

12:03.040 --> 12:03.880
Get lost now!

12:05.760 --> 12:08.000
Why did you put on an act with me today?

12:08.080 --> 12:09.120
Didn't you say

12:09.200 --> 12:11.240
you don't like me
watching the show in the teahouse?

12:11.320 --> 12:12.880
You have nothing to say now.

12:13.880 --> 12:18.080
"When Duke Su and Ms. Jiang Li
are together,

12:19.560 --> 12:21.080
they don't like being watched."

12:22.920 --> 12:24.440
You're saving me with your reputation.

12:43.640 --> 12:45.600
Bring Ms. Jiang Li
wherever she wants to go.

12:45.680 --> 12:46.680
Don't ask why.

12:47.360 --> 12:49.600
Protect her by the entrance
when you're there,

12:49.680 --> 12:52.040
then take her home when she's done.

12:52.520 --> 12:53.400
Yes.

12:53.960 --> 12:55.320
Thank you.

12:55.400 --> 12:57.480
You should go now, pretty lady.

14:09.240 --> 14:13.080
You're definitely Xue Li.

14:18.600 --> 14:19.560
Mute Granny.

14:31.240 --> 14:32.160
No, girl.

14:33.480 --> 14:34.640
You have to leave.

14:35.200 --> 14:37.480
Leave tonight.
Don't ever come back to Huaixiang.

14:37.560 --> 14:38.720
Why?

14:38.800 --> 14:42.120
Feng Yutang has already turned
a good place like Huaixiang into this.

14:42.200 --> 14:44.120
He surely has someone backing him up.

14:44.200 --> 14:47.240
He's afraid of nothing.
You can't defeat him.

14:47.800 --> 14:48.920
My current identity

14:49.760 --> 14:52.520
is that of the daughter
of the Chief Secretariat, Jiang Yuanbai.

14:54.360 --> 14:55.840
The Jiang family is powerful.

14:55.920 --> 14:57.080
They won't dare to touch me.

14:57.160 --> 14:59.920
The higher your status,
the more you'll harm Magistrate Xue.

15:00.000 --> 15:01.360
As long as Feng Yutang

15:01.440 --> 15:03.280
thinks Magistrate Xue is a threat,

15:03.760 --> 15:05.880
he may kill him anytime.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.680
I won't let them know

15:07.760 --> 15:09.080
that I'm here for Father.

15:09.160 --> 15:10.480
I need someone

15:10.960 --> 15:12.760
who can overturn Father's verdict

15:13.360 --> 15:15.600
and prove that Feng Yutang framed Father.

15:15.680 --> 15:17.480
This way, I can redress Father's grievance

15:17.560 --> 15:19.040
before he's executed.

15:19.120 --> 15:21.800
But the people you want

15:21.880 --> 15:23.280
can't save him.

15:23.840 --> 15:26.800
Gu Da, Gu Er, Peng Xiao, and He Jun.

15:26.880 --> 15:28.680
Those who were loyal

15:28.760 --> 15:30.600
to Magistrate Xue

15:30.680 --> 15:31.520
were sent

15:31.600 --> 15:33.440
to the sand mine in East Mountain.

15:33.520 --> 15:35.640
Everyone there works for Feng Yutang.

15:36.880 --> 15:38.080
No matter what,

15:40.160 --> 15:41.000
I must give it a try.

15:42.080 --> 15:44.280
Don't alert them.

15:44.360 --> 15:46.960
Or else, Magistrate Xue will suffer more.

15:47.040 --> 15:47.880
I know.

15:47.960 --> 15:49.960
You're with Feng Yutang every day.

15:50.040 --> 15:51.120
You're always in danger.

15:52.040 --> 15:53.040
Listen to me.

15:53.120 --> 15:54.920
I'll find a way
to bring you out, all right?

15:55.000 --> 15:56.080
If I disappear suddenly,

15:56.600 --> 15:58.120
your identity will be exposed.

15:58.200 --> 16:01.440
My life isn't worth anything.

16:02.000 --> 16:04.520
If Magistrate Xue
hadn't saved me back then,

16:05.440 --> 16:07.440
I would have starved to death.

16:09.000 --> 16:11.680
He's my savior. I can't leave.

16:11.760 --> 16:13.320
That rotten Feng Yutang thinks

16:14.440 --> 16:16.600
I'm a useless mute.

16:16.680 --> 16:18.000
He didn't kick me out.

16:18.680 --> 16:20.040
But he didn't expect

16:20.880 --> 16:23.640
that I'd be staying
by Magistrate Xue to wait for a chance.

16:24.320 --> 16:25.440
In a few days,

16:27.120 --> 16:29.000
if they really execute Magistrate Xue,

16:30.480 --> 16:31.720
I'll fight them with my life.

16:37.000 --> 16:37.880
No.

16:38.560 --> 16:41.120
Sacrificing your life for revenge

16:42.080 --> 16:43.400
is so not worth it.

16:43.480 --> 16:45.040
Since I'm back,

16:45.560 --> 16:48.120
I'll surely make sure
they get what they deserve.

16:50.200 --> 16:51.040
Xue Li.

16:55.960 --> 16:57.640
HUAIXIANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

17:03.880 --> 17:04.960
Thank you, everyone.

17:05.560 --> 17:06.760
This is ginseng chicken soup.

17:07.760 --> 17:09.000
Nourish yourself.

17:11.000 --> 17:12.520
What are you waiting for? Drink it.

17:13.200 --> 17:14.359
It was cooked for a long time.

17:18.560 --> 17:19.599
Don't be shy.

17:23.079 --> 17:24.440
Drink it while it's hot.

17:25.800 --> 17:27.000
It's still hot.

17:32.760 --> 17:34.360
- Magistrate…
- Come on.

17:35.280 --> 17:36.200
Drink it.

17:41.120 --> 17:42.360
Open your mouth.

17:42.960 --> 17:43.800
Drink it.

18:04.040 --> 18:07.960
- Magistrate Feng, have mercy!
- Magistrate Feng, spare us!

18:08.040 --> 18:10.120
It took me an entire day
to make this chicken soup.

18:13.360 --> 18:14.520
If you don't drink it,

18:15.200 --> 18:17.640
isn't it a waste of my effort?

18:20.320 --> 18:21.320
Who did she meet?

18:21.400 --> 18:23.200
Duke Su.

18:23.280 --> 18:25.120
Why did Duke Su come to Huaixiang?

18:25.840 --> 18:26.680
Get up.

18:32.000 --> 18:35.040
Duke Su seems to care a lot
about Jiang Li.

18:35.600 --> 18:37.000
He even brought her back himself.

18:37.760 --> 18:40.560
I'm afraid it won't be easy
to take action in the future.

18:40.640 --> 18:43.680
From now on, be smarter.

18:43.760 --> 18:45.360
If you're discovered again,

18:45.440 --> 18:46.680
you won't just have soup.

18:47.280 --> 18:48.400
You'll die.

18:53.880 --> 18:54.760
Get lost, all of you.

18:54.840 --> 18:55.760
Yes.

18:57.000 --> 18:57.880
Hold on.

19:11.640 --> 19:15.600
REFLECTION HALL

19:59.640 --> 20:00.480
Miss.

20:02.040 --> 20:02.920
What took you so long?

20:03.000 --> 20:03.880
Did something happen?

20:03.960 --> 20:05.360
Feng Yutang's men followed me.

20:06.120 --> 20:07.320
Luckily, I met Xiao Heng.

20:07.920 --> 20:09.120
Who's Xiao Heng?

20:10.760 --> 20:12.000
He's Duke Su.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.400
Why is he here?

20:14.480 --> 20:15.600
Did he come to see you?

20:15.680 --> 20:18.360
Let's talk about him later on.

20:18.440 --> 20:19.480
Back to the important topic.

20:19.560 --> 20:22.280
I got news about the people
who knew about the Xue family case.

20:22.360 --> 20:23.400
Where are they?

20:23.480 --> 20:24.960
At the sand mine of East Mountain.

20:25.040 --> 20:26.120
But now,

20:26.600 --> 20:28.400
the sand mine is filled
with Feng Yutang's men.

20:29.760 --> 20:30.600
Uncle Mingyu.

20:30.680 --> 20:32.040
Can you find enough helpers?

20:32.120 --> 20:34.280
I can get my buddies back in Luyang.

20:34.360 --> 20:36.880
But Feng Yutang is keeping
a close eye on our people.

20:36.960 --> 20:38.560
He knows

20:38.640 --> 20:39.600
our every move.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.320
Is there no other way?

20:43.720 --> 20:44.720
Well…

20:46.080 --> 20:46.920
There's one.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.600
My lord.

20:50.680 --> 20:52.760
We already know
the topography of the sand mine.

20:53.440 --> 20:55.280
There's a river between two mountains.

20:55.360 --> 20:57.280
By this part of the river
is the sand mine.

20:57.360 --> 20:58.680
Up the river,

20:58.760 --> 21:00.480
right here is the imperial gold mine.

21:01.080 --> 21:02.920
The imperial court sealed this gold mine.

21:03.000 --> 21:05.160
Huaixiang Government Office
is ordered to guard it.

21:05.240 --> 21:06.680
Without a pass, no one can enter.

21:07.160 --> 21:08.040
As for the rest,

21:09.040 --> 21:10.120
I haven't found out yet.

21:10.200 --> 21:12.120
The sand mine was only built
half a year ago,

21:12.200 --> 21:13.280
but the imperial gold mine

21:13.360 --> 21:14.560
had been mined for many years.

21:15.280 --> 21:16.640
The mine tunnels are very complex.

21:17.160 --> 21:18.760
Together with the impact of land damage,

21:18.840 --> 21:20.280
the tunnels must have changed a lot.

21:20.920 --> 21:23.520
Without a map, it'll be hard to get in.

21:23.600 --> 21:25.440
You're only good
at saying accurate nonsense.

21:25.520 --> 21:26.760
Then what idea do you have?

21:26.840 --> 21:28.080
Let's attack it forcefully.

21:28.160 --> 21:29.720
- Attack forcefully?
- Yes.

21:29.800 --> 21:31.560
I'll ask our people to charge.

21:31.640 --> 21:32.520
And then?

21:32.600 --> 21:33.440
Search.

21:33.520 --> 21:34.600
In the name of what?

21:34.680 --> 21:36.640
With our status and identity,

21:37.200 --> 21:39.080
can't we be overbearing, shameless,

21:39.760 --> 21:40.760
and unreasonable?

21:42.160 --> 21:43.120
What do you think?

21:43.200 --> 21:44.520
That's inaccurate nonsense.

21:44.600 --> 21:45.800
Give some ideas then.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.320
Here you are.

22:02.080 --> 22:03.120
Were you expecting me?

22:06.160 --> 22:07.160
You have no way to go now,

22:08.520 --> 22:09.680
little civet?

22:09.760 --> 22:11.360
I would like to borrow some manpower

22:12.200 --> 22:14.120
to go to the sand mine
in East Mountain together.

22:15.080 --> 22:16.240
Interesting.

22:16.320 --> 22:17.760
You have the same idea.

22:18.640 --> 22:20.360
This is my important thing.

22:20.440 --> 22:21.320
You can have manpower.

22:22.040 --> 22:24.280
But I can only help you
after I settle my affairs.

22:24.360 --> 22:25.440
This is urgent.

22:26.280 --> 22:27.440
I can't wait.

22:27.520 --> 22:28.600
Ms. Jiang Li.

22:31.120 --> 22:32.600
Don't be too bossy with me.

22:33.920 --> 22:35.360
Tell me

22:35.440 --> 22:36.560
what you need to settle.

22:36.640 --> 22:38.000
There's a sealed imperial gold mine

22:38.720 --> 22:40.040
upstream of the river
where the sand mine is.

22:40.120 --> 22:41.640
An imperial gold mine?

22:43.560 --> 22:44.520
You want to go in there?

22:45.080 --> 22:46.240
There's no way in now.

22:46.320 --> 22:47.880
We don't have the mine map.

22:48.440 --> 22:49.440
The mine map?

22:53.000 --> 22:53.840
Give me a moment.

23:03.800 --> 23:05.040
My rule is

23:05.120 --> 23:06.600
I need to know the source of this map.

23:06.680 --> 23:07.520
I can't tell you.

23:09.360 --> 23:11.360
But I can guarantee with my life

23:12.600 --> 23:13.920
that this map is real.

23:14.000 --> 23:15.880
I've heard this kind of speech many times.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.160
Xiao Heng.

23:26.640 --> 23:27.960
This map

23:29.360 --> 23:30.600
was someone's life.

23:31.080 --> 23:33.760
If you want it, take it.

23:34.280 --> 23:35.360
Ms. Jiang Li.

23:35.440 --> 23:37.480
His lordship has always been careful.

23:38.160 --> 23:39.640
You've gone too far.

23:40.280 --> 23:41.200
That's enough.

23:45.160 --> 23:47.120
I'll take the map.

23:49.280 --> 23:50.120
Tell me your plan.

23:51.360 --> 23:53.800
I want you to help me get into the mine

23:53.880 --> 23:56.520
to save the ex-subordinates
of Magistrate Xue.

23:56.600 --> 24:00.680
This sounds like saving lives
by sacrificing lives.

24:02.960 --> 24:05.400
I don't really want
to have this losing deal with you.

24:05.480 --> 24:06.360
The two of us

24:07.280 --> 24:08.960
have never had a fair deal.

24:10.280 --> 24:12.520
I'm just a pawn in your hand.

24:14.360 --> 24:16.240
I've even overestimated myself
by saying that.

24:17.120 --> 24:18.080
From the beginning,

24:18.600 --> 24:20.880
I was probably not even a pawn.

24:31.720 --> 24:33.600
I used you to go back to the Jiang family

24:34.600 --> 24:36.160
and you've been observing me since then.

24:38.160 --> 24:39.960
It was originally due to doubt.

24:40.040 --> 24:42.200
Ever since the bet
between the Li family and me,

24:43.040 --> 24:45.480
you've been fanning
the flames from behind.

24:45.560 --> 24:48.040
You don't want the Li family
to recruit Ye Shijie,

24:48.120 --> 24:49.200
so you provoked them

24:49.280 --> 24:51.200
by using me
to distance the Ye and Li families.

24:51.280 --> 24:54.040
That's why you treated my hand twice

24:54.120 --> 24:55.960
to help me be
the Annual Exam's first placer.

24:56.840 --> 24:58.200
You've been observing

24:58.760 --> 25:01.200
to see if I was qualified to be your pawn.

25:01.280 --> 25:03.120
Only after I went to Luyang

25:03.200 --> 25:06.160
and fought with the Li family
to protect the Ye family

25:07.240 --> 25:10.040
that you started treating me as your pawn.

25:11.280 --> 25:12.120
Is that right?

25:12.200 --> 25:13.960
Why should I go against the Li family?

25:14.480 --> 25:17.080
From searching for the dirty money
of the trafficked salt

25:17.160 --> 25:19.480
to entering the imperial gold mine.

25:20.440 --> 25:23.280
What you're investigating
is clear even without saying.

25:23.840 --> 25:26.600
In recent years, the capital
has seen frequent corruption cases.

25:26.680 --> 25:28.880
Those who died were insignificant people.

25:29.640 --> 25:32.360
There must be someone
making money behind these people.

25:32.440 --> 25:35.520
Do you know who these people are?

25:35.600 --> 25:37.640
How could I have
such a great capability alone?

25:38.680 --> 25:40.640
But I can see it through your eyes.

25:41.600 --> 25:42.640
From the capital to Luyang,

25:43.760 --> 25:45.920
your eyes have always been
on the Li family.

25:46.600 --> 25:48.240
I can't help but think

25:48.320 --> 25:49.720
about what the connection is.

25:49.800 --> 25:50.720
That's right.

25:51.640 --> 25:53.560
Financial resources
in the capital were cut off,

25:54.040 --> 25:55.960
so Li Jin came to Luyang.

25:56.040 --> 25:57.000
What does Luyang have?

25:57.640 --> 25:59.080
The wealthy Ye family.

25:59.640 --> 26:01.720
Finance is the key to a nation.

26:02.200 --> 26:03.640
His Majesty must be worried.

26:03.720 --> 26:06.520
And you're traveling north and south

26:06.600 --> 26:08.760
to take down the Li family

26:08.840 --> 26:11.680
under His Majesty's order.

26:12.240 --> 26:13.080
Jiang Li.

26:15.000 --> 26:16.480
Do you have a death wish?

26:17.920 --> 26:18.960
Jiang Li wanted to live,

26:21.920 --> 26:22.880
but she couldn't.

26:24.160 --> 26:25.000
As for me,

26:25.480 --> 26:27.040
if you don't join my game,

26:27.560 --> 26:29.120
I won't live long.

26:31.880 --> 26:33.760
At this point,

26:33.840 --> 26:35.240
a pawn like you should be abandoned.

26:36.720 --> 26:38.800
How would you know
that I can't be the killer move?

26:38.880 --> 26:39.960
You're too presumptuous.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.360
I'll give my life to you.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.000
What did you say?

26:47.640 --> 26:48.480
I said

26:49.760 --> 26:51.520
I'll give my life to you.

26:53.040 --> 26:54.840
Keep using me as your pawn.

27:00.280 --> 27:01.880
I'm sorry, Ms. Jiang Li.

27:01.960 --> 27:03.800
I'm not interested
in this chess game anymore.

27:06.400 --> 27:07.520
Xiao Heng.

27:09.880 --> 27:11.560
Our methods will achieve the same result.

27:12.840 --> 27:13.920
You said that.

27:16.440 --> 27:17.680
Our methods

27:19.000 --> 27:19.920
will

27:21.000 --> 27:21.880
achieve

27:23.080 --> 27:23.920
the same result.

27:26.040 --> 27:27.160
You said that.

27:29.880 --> 27:31.000
Are you afraid?

27:33.920 --> 27:34.880
What am I afraid of?

27:34.960 --> 27:36.840
You're afraid to use my life as a pawn

27:38.640 --> 27:40.200
in the fame of the nation.

27:53.240 --> 27:56.080
Saving people from the sand mine
and going into the gold mine

27:57.080 --> 27:58.640
can be done at the same time.

27:58.720 --> 28:00.840
You don't have to go to the East Mountain.

28:00.920 --> 28:02.240
I must go.

28:06.600 --> 28:08.240
Before going to East Mountain,

28:08.800 --> 28:11.360
how can you get rid of Feng Yutang's men?

28:40.760 --> 28:41.720
PEOPLE'S SAFETY BRINGS BENEFITS

28:41.800 --> 28:43.040
All of a sudden,

28:43.520 --> 28:46.440
Ms. Jiang Li,
who looks almost exactly the same

28:46.520 --> 28:49.800
as your daughter, has appeared.

28:50.360 --> 28:51.640
And Duke Su.

28:52.600 --> 28:54.160
Since when did this little Huaixiang

28:54.240 --> 28:55.680
become so lively?

28:56.160 --> 28:57.440
Why did they come?

28:59.080 --> 29:00.840
They didn't come earlier or later.

29:01.840 --> 29:04.440
As soon as the Ministry of Justice
approved your execution,

29:05.360 --> 29:06.320
they came here.

29:07.920 --> 29:09.200
What a coincidence.

29:09.280 --> 29:10.600
Xue Li.

29:13.920 --> 29:15.680
Is it possible

29:15.760 --> 29:18.160
that they came here for you?

29:19.360 --> 29:20.240
Xue Li.

29:23.120 --> 29:24.560
In that case,

29:28.040 --> 29:29.360
I'm sorry.

29:37.120 --> 29:39.000
You must die earlier.

29:40.600 --> 29:41.480
Xue Li.

29:43.080 --> 29:43.920
Xue Li.

29:47.800 --> 29:48.760
Xue Li.

30:00.560 --> 30:03.480
PEOPLE'S SAFETY BRINGS BENEFITS

30:03.560 --> 30:05.720
Magistrate, we have news about them.

30:05.800 --> 30:06.880
We split into several groups

30:07.360 --> 30:08.600
to follow each of them.

30:09.160 --> 30:11.320
Ms. Jiang Li and the others
went to the grain store.

30:12.440 --> 30:13.920
Duke Su went to the black market.

30:14.400 --> 30:16.360
And someone went to the farmer's house.

30:16.440 --> 30:18.080
Why did they go to these places?

30:18.160 --> 30:19.680
They all went to buy food.

30:19.760 --> 30:22.640
Buying food through different channels,

30:22.720 --> 30:24.680
then comparing the prices and quality.

30:25.520 --> 30:26.880
Nice one.

30:26.960 --> 30:29.120
They want to find fault with the granary.

30:30.760 --> 30:32.960
- Who's guarding the granary?
- Monkey.

30:33.040 --> 30:33.920
How many are there?

30:34.000 --> 30:36.880
- Four.
- Four… How many?

30:36.960 --> 30:38.960
Four.

30:40.600 --> 30:44.400
I… Four?

30:44.480 --> 30:45.880
- No.
- Why not just open the granary

30:45.960 --> 30:46.840
and show them?

30:46.920 --> 30:47.960
Don't be angry, Magistrate.

30:48.040 --> 30:49.640
Elites are guarding the granary.

30:49.720 --> 30:51.880
There are too many people to follow.

30:51.960 --> 30:53.440
We lack manpower, so we sent them here.

30:53.520 --> 30:55.880
Transfer them back
and follow me to the granary.

30:57.360 --> 30:59.480
If they're not planning
to do anything in the granary,

30:59.560 --> 31:01.440
I'll eat shit.

31:01.520 --> 31:02.360
Yes.

31:02.840 --> 31:04.560
- Let's go.
- Come on.

31:23.520 --> 31:24.520
You guys, go this way.

31:27.520 --> 31:28.440
You, this way.

31:45.880 --> 31:46.720
Hurry.

31:47.600 --> 31:48.560
- Go.
- Be gentle.

31:48.640 --> 31:50.000
Behave yourself.

31:50.080 --> 31:52.480
- It hurts. Let go.
- Hurry.

31:53.440 --> 31:54.280
Move.

31:54.360 --> 31:56.000
- Is there only a few of them?
- Hurry.

31:56.080 --> 31:57.280
- Where are the others?
- Let go.

31:57.360 --> 31:58.600
There's no one else.

32:02.720 --> 32:03.640
All right.

32:04.640 --> 32:07.000
Are you playing a diversion trick with me?

32:07.080 --> 32:08.080
Lock him up.

32:08.880 --> 32:10.400
- The rest of you, come with me.
- Let's go.

32:14.200 --> 32:15.200
- Don't move.
- All right.

32:52.480 --> 32:54.120
That was a good idea, Ms. Jiang Li.

32:54.200 --> 32:55.560
How did you come up with this plan?

32:56.560 --> 32:57.800
A granary

32:58.360 --> 33:00.360
eases people's minds and helps in war.

33:01.880 --> 33:05.760
I entrusted you with the duty
of supervising the granary.

33:06.360 --> 33:08.680
Yet you resorted to fraud

33:08.760 --> 33:10.200
and stole from the nation.

33:11.360 --> 33:13.640
Take off your official uniform.

33:13.720 --> 33:15.120
You don't deserve to be an official.

33:15.840 --> 33:17.240
It was just a lucky bet.

33:18.320 --> 33:20.120
Where there's grain,
there's always corruption.

33:20.600 --> 33:22.000
I'm sure Feng Yutang will panic

33:22.080 --> 33:23.560
when we attack the granary.

33:23.640 --> 33:25.240
It seems like I also made the right bet.

33:25.320 --> 33:26.840
I knew you would have a way.

33:53.880 --> 33:55.720
- Eight people.
- Let's check the sand mine below.

33:58.560 --> 34:00.640
The people you're looking for
are not at the sand mine.

34:00.720 --> 34:01.840
That's just a cover.

34:03.120 --> 34:04.400
They should be in this mine cave.

34:07.560 --> 34:10.239
I know there's an entrance if we go south

34:10.840 --> 34:12.159
around this mountain.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.239
My lord.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.199
I can handle this.

34:17.719 --> 34:18.560
Let's do as she says.

34:18.639 --> 34:19.480
Come on.

34:44.199 --> 34:45.159
It should be here.

34:46.639 --> 34:47.480
Are you sure?

34:48.360 --> 34:49.320
Yes.

34:49.880 --> 34:51.520
This tunnel is narrow.

34:52.000 --> 34:54.000
Perhaps because it's inconvenient
for transportation.

34:54.639 --> 34:56.040
So it was abandoned.

34:56.120 --> 34:57.320
I will have a look first.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.120
Which way?

35:50.600 --> 35:53.040
I remember
there was no such fork on the map.

35:54.000 --> 35:55.400
I don't know which way to go either.

35:55.480 --> 35:56.520
Let's split up.

35:57.200 --> 35:58.400
You and I go this way.

35:58.480 --> 35:59.400
Then I'll go this way.

35:59.480 --> 36:03.000
I think that way looks
more like the path on the map.

36:03.080 --> 36:04.120
Let's go that way.

36:04.200 --> 36:06.040
Then we'll switch. Let's go.

36:31.920 --> 36:34.000
Duke Su, how is it down there?
Is there a path?

36:36.080 --> 36:36.920
Come down.

37:13.120 --> 37:14.080
Be careful.

37:45.960 --> 37:46.800
Let's go.

38:35.960 --> 38:36.800
What are you doing?

38:37.360 --> 38:38.240
Be alert.

38:38.880 --> 38:40.040
What are you afraid of?

38:40.120 --> 38:42.560
They're all working at this time.

38:42.640 --> 38:43.680
What could happen?

38:44.240 --> 38:45.080
Hey,

38:45.160 --> 38:46.480
can you stop being so lazy?

38:47.320 --> 38:49.280
- What if they catch us?
- Why are you looking at me?

38:49.360 --> 38:50.600
- Go.
- What's the matter?

38:50.680 --> 38:52.280
- Look who's…
- You begged me to come here.

38:52.760 --> 38:56.920
- I'm so tired these days. Look at my back.
- You must do the physical work yourself.

38:57.000 --> 39:00.120
- Massage it a bit.
- Should I serve you?

39:00.760 --> 39:01.840
You're unbelievable.

39:01.920 --> 39:03.560
Let me tell you, if anything happens,

39:03.640 --> 39:04.840
both of us will be in trouble.

39:05.840 --> 39:07.120
You're scaring me again.

39:07.200 --> 39:08.280
You want me to massage you?

39:08.360 --> 39:09.480
Dream on.

39:10.000 --> 39:11.320
Fine.

39:11.400 --> 39:12.600
I think

39:13.120 --> 39:15.640
you're only doing useless things.

39:15.720 --> 39:16.560
- You…
- Listen.

39:16.640 --> 39:18.000
Just stop your nonsense.

39:19.360 --> 39:20.200
Well…

39:28.840 --> 39:31.800
Miss, do you want to dance with me?

39:31.880 --> 39:33.440
Let's dance.

39:33.520 --> 39:35.280
Miss, are you lost?

39:35.360 --> 39:36.960
Don't be afraid.

39:37.040 --> 39:38.360
Have a drink with us.

39:38.440 --> 39:40.520
- We'll show you the way out.
- Right.

39:40.600 --> 39:42.040
Come on, miss.

39:45.160 --> 39:47.360
Miss, you're sneaky.

39:52.560 --> 39:53.400
Duke Su.

39:55.920 --> 39:56.840
I took care of them.

39:56.920 --> 39:58.000
Well done.

40:17.360 --> 40:19.160
It's fine.
I can do this kind of physical work.

40:19.240 --> 40:20.120
Stop talking nonsense.

40:20.840 --> 40:22.640
Stay 3.5 m away.

40:43.160 --> 40:45.240
Put this on. Be quick.

41:25.840 --> 41:26.680
Put it on.

41:39.560 --> 41:40.400
Check.

41:42.520 --> 41:45.360
Compared to your personality,
this move seems to be

41:45.920 --> 41:47.800
quite radical.

41:47.880 --> 41:51.200
There's low risk and great benefit.
I shouldn't be conservative.

41:51.280 --> 41:53.200
Sometimes, the risk may seem small,

41:53.280 --> 41:56.080
but that's when you need
to be more careful.

41:58.640 --> 41:59.720
Check again.

42:04.200 --> 42:05.040
Mr. Li.

42:12.880 --> 42:15.440
DUKE SU IS ALREADY IN HUAIXIANG.
PLEASE PROVIDE INSTRUCTIONS.

42:18.200 --> 42:19.200
What happened?

42:19.680 --> 42:23.000
Jiang Li and Xiao Heng are in Huaixiang.

42:24.000 --> 42:25.200
They found out

42:27.560 --> 42:28.680
about the imperial gold mine.

42:32.880 --> 42:35.240
How will you counter this move?

42:36.360 --> 42:37.840
I'm long prepared.

42:42.840 --> 42:43.680
Hurry up!

42:46.040 --> 42:47.120
Work harder.

42:47.200 --> 42:48.640
Don't slack off.

42:51.800 --> 42:52.760
Hurry.

42:54.200 --> 42:55.040
Be quick.

42:58.080 --> 42:59.000
Hurry up!

43:00.160 --> 43:02.320
- An earthquake hit here three years ago.
- Be quick.

43:03.040 --> 43:03.880
Someone claimed

43:03.960 --> 43:05.840
that mining here was harmful
to the mountain,

43:07.080 --> 43:08.880
so the imperial court sealed
this gold mine.

43:09.480 --> 43:10.560
But now, why…

43:10.640 --> 43:11.880
What are you doing?

43:14.720 --> 43:15.640
Get up.

43:15.720 --> 43:16.680
Did you know about this?

43:18.880 --> 43:21.960
Did you come to Huaixiang
to investigate this gold mine?

43:22.040 --> 43:23.920
But this is the gold mine
of the imperial court.

43:24.000 --> 43:25.760
Unauthorized mining is a crime of treason.

43:26.280 --> 43:27.760
How dare the local government do this?

43:30.680 --> 43:31.760
Gold mine?

43:33.080 --> 43:33.960
Hurry up.

43:36.040 --> 43:37.320
The Xue family's three members.

43:40.320 --> 43:41.200
Shen Yurong.

43:41.760 --> 43:42.640
Eldest Princess.

43:43.640 --> 43:45.240
It turns out all these are related.

43:45.720 --> 43:46.560
So

43:47.760 --> 43:50.600
do you know
what consequence you're facing?
